  - Instrumental and atmospheric noise
abstract: >-
  Source and installation tools for reproducible SAT/LAT noise realizations,
  configurable observation synthesis, and Sehgal2010-based CAMB/lenspyx CMB
  generation using matched archived mmDL convergence maps. The large input
  sky maps are held separately; the software license decision is pending.
